{"id":2604,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为丰富校园心理育人形式，以趣味活动舒缓学生心理压力、焕发青春活力，5月21日下午四点四十，经济与管理学院心理辅导站开展校园捉迷藏主题活动，吸引学院三十余名学生积极参与。本次活动采用线上实时定位的创新玩法，趣味性与互动性十足。活动前期，参与者扫码加入高德地图活动群，通过抽签选出“猫”与“鼠”两大阵营，全员佩戴手环后开启藏匿准备。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_M8nF2Uz7bo7CsM97CZnRCiLmAfMRfA2MlMfLRLsU4Q2LRN0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkMSyinSy4nRrVMzMRM4VRo7WRMznkMl7sM4-YU8VVLzWFLz9PL7CbnzTFL4G8nNlJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGDoSbw6218c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24069&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6B55E3D5E53C71C8BC54B5A7722CAE12/1810F9E9/304FE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_M8nF2Uz7bo7CsM97CZnRCiLmAfMRfA2MlMfLRLsU4Q2LRN0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkMSyinSy4nRrVMzMRM4VRo7WRMznkMl7sM4-YU8VVLzWFLz9PL7CbnzTFL4G8nNlJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGDoSbw6218c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24069&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>活动设置十分钟自由躲藏时间，时限结束后全员开启位置共享，正式进入追逐对战模式。游戏中，被抓捕的“鼠”玩家即刻转换身份、加入“猫”的追捕队伍，大幅提升了游戏的可玩性与氛围感。活动过程氛围轻松热烈，同学们在奔跑互动中放松身心、增进友谊。多名同学凭借灵敏反应与出色表现脱颖而出，徐泽庆、窦思楠、霍然、王玉顺、封云、赵贺金六人赢得奖品。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nzLF8Mzl8nz9aL9znfnNn2Ul7iMNlAZM4n2M4QRnmlYM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaoSy4okhVU4CDMR6VLlWfUz-ZMNU4nzlPozNaU49PMRTFL8-sU4r2MzAFLmQVU4vJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGDoSbw6218c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24069&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/00938EC6647E1BAA286D3E51990C8149/3B7C5F58/26EC7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_nzLF8Mzl8nz9aL9znfnNn2Ul7iMNlAZM4n2M4QRnmlYM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaoSy4okhVU4CDMR6VLlWfUz-ZMNU4nzlPozNaU49PMRTFL8-sU4r2MzAFLmQVU4vJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGDoSbw6218c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24069&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p><p>本次捉迷藏趣味活动以娱润心、以乐疗心，创新了心理健康教育形式，有效缓解了学生的学业焦虑与心理压力，助力学生在趣味实践中调节情绪、收获成长。未来，学院心理辅导站将持续立足学生心理需求，创新活动载体，开展更多贴合学生生活的心理健康教育活动，积极营造积极阳光、温暖互助的校园心理育人氛围。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_MmCFbM4laMRvZn9RCaLNLsnNrVMRVARL4GiMlr7M8-8U4C0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyaoSyDn1yYnmCYM4MRUznfM7UDUlQ2MlnVL7-iLzM7n7MFnNMVnNlDnzVFLmv8oRGJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGDoSbw6218c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24069&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/3096F2F6273CA4A4D6AFF5DE0B513DDC/FCEFE6E1/27480\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_MmCFbM4laMRvZn9RCaLNLsnNrVMRVARL4GiMlr7M8-8U4C0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyaoSyDn1yYnmCYM4MRUznfM7UDUlQ2MlnVL7-iLzM7n7MFnNMVnNlDnzVFLmv8oRGJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGDoSbw6218c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24069&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=_M8nF2Uz7bo7CsM97CZnRCiLmAfMRfA2MlMfLRLsU4Q2LRN0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hkMSyinSy4nRrVMzMRM4VRo7WRMznkMl7sM4-YU8VVLzWFLz9PL7CbnzTFL4G8nNlJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGDoSbw6218c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24069&e=.jpeg"}